#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid ""
"A great party doesn't have to be complicated. With the right choices, you "
"get a long way."
msgstr ""
"Een sterk feest hoeft niet ingewikkeld te zijn. Met de juiste keuzes kom je "
"al heel ver."

#. module: byp_website
#: model:website.menu,name:byp_website.menu_about
msgid "About us"
msgstr "Over ons"

#. module: byp_website
#: model:ir.ui.view,website_meta_title:byp_website.page_about
msgid "About us - Build Your Party"
msgstr "Over ons - Build Your Party"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid ""
"Absolutely. We'd love to hear from companies that add something to the Build"
" Your Party offer. Send us more information about your products, services, "
"region and way of working, and we'll see whether there is a match."
msgstr ""
"Zeker. We horen graag van bedrijven die iets toevoegen aan het aanbod van "
"Build Your Party. Stuur ons wat meer info over je producten, diensten, regio"
" en werkwijze, dan bekijken we of er een match is."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"Absolutely. You don't have to take a full package. Tables, chairs and other "
"party furniture can also be chosen separately."
msgstr ""
"Zeker. Je hoeft geen volledig pakket te nemen. Tafels, stoelen en ander "
"feestmeubilair kunnen ook apart gekozen worden."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.template_footer_byp
msgid "Back to top"
msgstr "Naar boven"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "Banquet hall set for a large event"
msgstr "Feestzaal gedekt voor een groot event"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid "Big party."
msgstr "Groots feest."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid "Born from Creact"
msgstr "Ontstaan vanuit Creact"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.template_footer_byp
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.template_header_byp
msgid "Build Your Party"
msgstr ""

#. module: byp_website
#: model:ir.ui.view,website_meta_title:byp_website.homepage
msgid "Build Your Party - big party, sorted"
msgstr "Build Your Party - groots feest, zo geregeld"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid ""
"Build Your Party grew out of the knowledge and experience of Creact. For "
"larger or more complex events, Creact remains the partner for custom work."
msgstr ""
"Build Your Party groeide vanuit de kennis en ervaring van Creact. Voor "
"grotere of complexere events blijft Creact de partner voor maatwerk."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid ""
"Build Your Party is ideal for small to medium-sized parties you like to "
"organise yourself. For larger or more complex events that need more "
"guidance, we are happy to refer you to Creact."
msgstr ""
"Build Your Party is ideaal voor kleine tot middelgrote feesten die je graag "
"zelf organiseert. Voor grotere of complexere events met meer begeleiding "
"verwijzen we je graag door naar Creact."

#. module: byp_website
#: model:ir.ui.view,website_meta_description:byp_website.page_about
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid ""
"Build Your Party makes it easier to pull off a great party yourself. With "
"clear choices, a smart offer and a grip on your budget, you arrange more "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Build Your Party maakt het makkelijker om zelf een sterk feest neer te "
"zetten. Met duidelijke keuzes, een slim aanbod en grip op je budget regel je"
" meer zelf."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid "Build something"
msgstr "Samen iets"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.tool_page
msgid "Build your"
msgstr "Bouw je"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid "Build your package"
msgstr "Stel je pakket samen"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.template_header_byp
msgid "Build your party"
msgstr "Maak hier je feest"

#. module: byp_website
#: model:ir.ui.view,website_meta_title:byp_website.tool_page
msgid "Build your party - Build Your Party"
msgstr "Bouw je feest - Build Your Party"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid "Built on experience"
msgstr "Gebouwd op ervaring"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid ""
"By choosing smartly and rolling up your sleeves, you get more out of your "
"party budget."
msgstr ""
"Door slim te kiezen en zelf de handen uit de mouwen te steken, haal je meer "
"uit je feestbudget."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid "Can I become a supplier?"
msgstr "Kan ik leverancier worden?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "Can I combine tents and furniture?"
msgstr "Kan ik tenten en meubilair combineren?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid "Can I propose a new product or concept?"
msgstr "Kan ik een nieuw product of concept voorstellen?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "Can I rent just furniture?"
msgstr "Kan ik ook enkel meubilair huren?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"Choose a tent that suits your location, number of guests and the atmosphere "
"you want. From a compact canopy to a larger party tent with room for tables,"
" a bar and a dance floor."
msgstr ""
"Kies een tent die past bij je locatie, aantal gasten en gewenste sfeer. Van "
"een compacte overkapping tot een grotere feesttent met ruimte voor tafels, "
"bar en dansvloer."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.tool_page
msgid ""
"Choose your date, the number of guests and your formula. The price updates "
"live, and you book with a deposit."
msgstr ""
"Kies je datum, het aantal gasten en je formule. De prijs rekent live mee, en"
" je boekt met een voorschot."

