#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid ""
"Everything was crystal clear and ready on time. All we had to do was set up "
"and enjoy."
msgstr ""
"Alles was superduidelijk en stond op tijd klaar. Wij hoefden alleen nog op "
"te bouwen en te genieten."

