#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.byp_faq
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Veelgestelde vragen"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"From burgers and pizza to street food and sweets: choose a food truck that "
"suits your party and your guests. That way you add atmosphere and great food"
" to your event right away, without the hassle."
msgstr ""
"Van burgers en pizza tot streetfood en zoet: kies een foodtruck die past bij"
" jouw feest en je gasten. Zo voeg je zonder gedoe meteen sfeer én lekker "
"eten toe aan je event."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "From canopy to party tent"
msgstr "Van overkapping tot feesttent"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"From concept and planning to full execution: there you get support tailored "
"to your event."
msgstr ""
"Van concept en planning tot volledige uitvoering: daar krijg je "
"ondersteuning op maat van je event."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "From street food to dessert"
msgstr "Van streetfood tot dessert"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"From tables and chairs to high tables, lighting, bars and other party "
"furniture: choose what you need to make your venue practical and cosy."
msgstr ""
"Van tafels en stoelen tot statafels, verlichting, bars en ander "
"feestmeubilair: kies zelf wat je nodig hebt om jouw locatie praktisch én "
"gezellig in te richten."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "From tables to chairs"
msgstr "Van tafels tot stoelen"

#. module: byp_website
#: model:ir.ui.view,website_meta_description:byp_website.page_services
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"From tents and furniture to food trucks: choose what you need and put your "
"party together easily, your way and within your budget."
msgstr ""
"Van tenten en meubilair tot foodtrucks: kies wat je nodig hebt en stel je "
"feest eenvoudig samen op jouw manier en binnen jouw budget."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "Furnish your party entirely yourself"
msgstr "Richt je feest helemaal zelf in"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid "Gaversesteenweg 422 bus 001,<br/>9820 Merelbeke-Melle"
msgstr ""

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid ""
"Get more party out of your budget.<br/>\n"
"                        Professional equipment, smartly chosen for a party that looks like the professionals did it."
msgstr ""
"Haal meer feest uit je budget.<br/>\n"
"                        Professioneel materiaal, slim gekozen voor een feest dat eruitziet alsof de professionals het deden."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid ""
"Gladly. If you have something that fits the Build Your Party concept, feel "
"free to send it over. We always look at new ideas in terms of the added "
"value for our users."
msgstr ""
"Graag. Heb je iets dat goed aansluit bij het Build Your Party-concept, stuur"
" het gerust door. We bekijken nieuwe ideeën altijd vanuit de meerwaarde voor"
" onze gebruikers."

