#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid "We deliver everything"
msgstr "Wij leveren alles"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"We deliver everything to you. You decide the layout and set everything up "
"the way that suits your party. That way you easily create the right "
"atmosphere, without unnecessary extra costs."
msgstr ""
"Wij leveren alles bij jou. Jij bepaalt de opstelling en zet alles klaar "
"zoals het bij jouw feest past. Zo creëer je eenvoudig de juiste sfeer, "
"zonder onnodige extra kosten."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid ""
"We deliver the equipment you chose to the agreed location at the agreed "
"time. That way you can start setting up at your own pace, whenever it suits "
"you."
msgstr ""
"We leveren je gekozen materialen op de afgesproken locatie en het "
"afgesproken moment. Zo kan je rustig aan de opbouw beginnen wanneer het jou "
"uitkomt."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid ""
"We're open to a wide range of collaborations within events, such as tents, "
"furniture, catering, food trucks, equipment and additional services."
msgstr ""
"We staan open voor uiteenlopende samenwerkingen binnen events, zoals tenten,"
" meubilair, catering, foodtrucks, materialen en aanvullende diensten."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid "What can I put together myself?"
msgstr "Wat kan ik allemaal zelf samenstellen?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "What kinds of tents can I choose?"
msgstr "Welke soorten tenten kan ik kiezen?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_professionals
msgid "What partners are you looking for?"
msgstr "Welke partners zoeken jullie?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "Which food trucks are available?"
msgstr "Welke foodtrucks zijn beschikbaar?"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid ""
"With years of experience in events, Jarne saw how much time and budget is "
"often lost to needless arranging. Build Your Party makes that simpler."
msgstr ""
"Met jaren ervaring in events zag Jarne hoe veel tijd en budget er vaak "
"verloren gaat aan onnodig geregel. Build Your Party maakt dat eenvoudiger."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid ""
"Yes, but we keep it simple. Everything is selected so you can easily install"
" it yourself. That way you save on setup costs and get more out of your "
"party budget."
msgstr ""
"Ja, maar we houden het eenvoudig. Alles is geselecteerd zodat je het "
"makkelijk zelf kunt installeren. Zo bespaar je op opbouwkosten en haal je "
"meer uit je feestbudget."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"Yes. You put together your own package and combine only the parts you need "
"for your party."
msgstr ""
"Ja. Je stelt zelf je pakket samen en combineert alleen de onderdelen die je "
"nodig hebt voor jouw feest."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid ""
"You choose from different sizes and layouts, depending on your location, "
"number of guests and type of party."
msgstr ""
"Je kiest uit verschillende formaten en opstellingen, afhankelijk van je "
"locatie, aantal gasten en type feest."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid ""
"You choose what you need for your party, from tents and furniture to food "
"trucks and extra equipment. That way you put together a package that fits "
"your location, guests and budget."
msgstr ""
"Je kiest zelf wat je nodig hebt voor jouw feest, van tenten en meubilair tot"
" foodtrucks en extra materialen. Zo stel je een pakket samen dat past bij je"
" locatie, gasten en budget."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_about
msgid ""
"You decide what your party looks like, what you do yourself and what you "
"spend your budget on."
msgstr ""
"Jij bepaalt hoe je feest eruitziet, wat je zelf doet en waar je je budget "
"aan besteedt."

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.homepage
msgid "You set it up"
msgstr "Jij bouwt op"

#. module: byp_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:byp_website.page_services
msgid "Your choice."
msgstr "Jouw keuze."

